.tickets/**/*.md text eol=lf
.tickets/**/*.md merge=gitticket
# Built output, committed so the Go binary can embed it and verified against
# the source by scripts/verify-dist.mjs. Nobody reads a minified diff, so git
# reports these as binary in a local diff or log. Forgejo does not honour this
# in the diff it serves for a pull request, because a bare repository reads no
# attributes, so a PR that rebuilds the bundle still carries it; see
# TKT-01M2Y9YXMRRAD5GP0953VY9AKC (Keep the built bundle out of what a PR review reads).
web/dist/** -diff
